"Nick's wand is an orientation gift, Uncommon and soulbound, with three charges a day."
"It hides the Living Artifact modification and absorbs essence to recharge."
"After drinking the Janitor's core it turns Rare, with five charges and a dial to narrow its cone."
"At Rare it raises its bearer's Wand cap from 25 to 50."
"It later evolves to Epic, with ten charges and up to three blasts at once."
"At Epic it raises the Wand cap to 75, and its wood turns golden with silver flakes."
"It absorbs no recoil, so its bearer can fire it at himself to change course in the air."
"It evolves again only with far more essence and a compatible Concept."
